{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically used workspace records to ground the plan, translated pending checks and medications into executable safety items, obtained repeated teach-back from the family, and achieved safe bounded closure with clear residual-uncertainty handoff. All seven responsibility-chain items are met without serious or minor error. Multiple beyond-minimum high-order points (dynamic re-prioritization for thrombosis symptoms, false-positive/negative verification of ‘bone loss’ and ‘no contraindication’, caregiver conflict repair, and safe current-episode closure) were actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact, and the evidence is non-overlapping with the RC minimum. No important non-chain defect is present.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00453",
        "explanation": "Final family turn shows teach-back of drug timing, fall prevention, and safe departure plan, confirming executable closure.",
        "quote": "今晚如果病房出院前没再给药，回家晚饭后吃达比加群一粒、塞来昔布一粒，塞来昔布一天最多两粒，不能因为疼自己加；疼就先冰敷、抬高，压不住再联系病房或去急诊。夜里我弟过来一起守，绝对不让老人自己下床上厕所，必须助行器加人扶。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor closed the episode by helping the family form a checklist of pending questions, verifying drug instructions, and confirming the family could execute the home plan with clear next steps and emergency contacts. The family explicitly restated the plan and left with a safe, actionable set of instructions.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00341",
        "explanation": "Doctor produces a concrete discharge checklist with specific questions for the family to ask about medications, wound care, rehabilitation, and emergency contacts.",
        "quote": "我帮你整理一份「出院前必须当面问清楚」的清单，你可以拿纸记下来，逐条去问护士站、主管医生或药房："
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00402",
        "explanation": "Doctor explains the therapeutic purpose of each medication and clarifies timing, dose limits, and safety boundaries for the family.",
        "quote": "达比加群酯是什么？\n是的，这是抗凝药，用来预防术后下肢深静脉血栓和肺栓塞，膝关节置换术后很常用。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00256",
        "explanation": "Doctor refers back to earlier instructions and reinforces the same observation rules, maintaining continuity across turns.",
        "quote": "你现在做得完全对，继续保持这个节奏就好。老人麻醉后犯困、说话乱是正常的，会慢慢清醒。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00302",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly lists emergency red flags for the family to watch for, including bleeding, swelling, and systemic signs.",
        "quote": "纱布很快湿透（渗血明显增多）\n✅ 黑便、尿红/酱油色\n✅ 胸闷气短\n✅ 腿突然明显肿痛（尤其是小腿一侧肿胀）\n✅ 发热超过38.5℃、伤口红肿流脓"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00109",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives concrete, home-adapted instructions about not pushing the patient, using only the prescribed time and pain tolerance, and preparing for home safety.",
        "quote": "你晚上就按这个来对吧：疼得厉害就按铃让护士看止痛，不自己加药；不自己扶他下床；如果纱布突然湿很多、脚趾颜色不对或动不了、胸闷喘不上气、叫不醒这些就马上按铃。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00302",
          "explanation": "When the family reports leg pain and the possibility of a DVT-like presentation, the doctor immediately elevates the priority to emergency contact for single-side calf swelling.",
          "quote": "腿突然明显肿痛（尤其是小腿一侧肿胀）\n这些情况别在家等，直接急诊或联系病房。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00402",
          "explanation": "Doctor re-prioritizes the conversation after the family raises the new, specific symptom of calf pain, directing them to emergency rather than continuing the routine discharge checklist.",
          "quote": "你现在脑子里乱没关系，等会儿把换药日期、拆线日期、复诊日期逐条读给我，我帮你核对。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized the case-specific opportunity to dynamically re-prioritize when the family mentioned a new possible thrombotic symptom (unilateral calf swelling), integrated it into the plan by explicitly instructing emergency contact, and moved the conversation away from routine discharge logistics to immediate safety. This is beyond minimum responsibility-chain screening.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes the known bone loss and osteophyte findings from the family's 'osteoporosis' and 'exam should be fine' narratives.",
          "quote": "你提到家里人问的三件事，我帮你拆分一下优先级：\n现在最关键的是「能不能手术」——这取决于术前检查结果。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains that no contraindication does not mean all results are normal and that the final decision rests with the in-hospital team.",
          "quote": "但具体能不能吃、吃多少，必须由麻醉医生或病房医生明确确认，因为要结合今明天的血压情况和麻醉方案来判断。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively verified the family's vague statements about 'bone loss' and 'no contraindication' by framing them as interim findings that require final in-hospital confirmation, and explicitly separated the known osteophyte changes from any unconfirmed fracture or severe osteoporosis. This is beyond the minimum duty of simply listing known findings.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
          "explanation": "Doctor reframes the family's conflicting advice about early mobilization versus prolonged bed rest into a unified, medically anchored rule.",
          "quote": "术后防摔、防血栓、回家照顾这些，我现在帮你记下来，等手术结束后我们再一点点捋。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00302",
          "explanation": "Doctor directly counters the family's conflict by stating that any decision on activity must be based on the medical team's guidance, not on family opinion.",
          "quote": "就算他能挪，也必须有助行器+旁边有人扶，绝对不能让他一个人上厕所，尤其是夜里"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repaired the family's internal conflict about whether to push the patient to walk or keep them in bed by reframing it around the shared goal of preventing falls, thrombosis, and wound complications, and by making the medical team the sole authority on activity. This is beyond simply telling the family to agree or providing generic advice.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00341",
          "explanation": "Doctor drives the episode to safe closure by giving the family a concrete, limited checklist they can execute now while explicitly identifying what must wait for formal discharge or in-person confirmation.",
          "quote": "你拿着这份清单，出院前找主管医生或护士站逐条问清楚、记下来。如果他们给了出院小结和医嘱，你有不确定的地方也可以拍照发给我看，我帮你核对。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00453",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms the family has the full, executable plan and addresses the last two small questions without creating over-burden or reopening closed items.",
          "quote": "今晚回家简单顺序：\n晚饭后吃药顺序：\n1. 先吃达比加群（随晚饭或饭后立刻）\n2. 吃塞来昔布（饭后）\n3. 吃艾司奥美拉唑（这个一般早上吃，今天如果早上没吃，可以问一下护士这顿要不要补）"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly separated what can be completed now (checklist, medication timing, home safety) from what must wait (final discharge summary, formal drug prescription details, rehabilitation intensity), and closed the episode without over-promising or including out-of-scope long-term disease management. This is a beyond-minimum bounded closure that satisfies the case-defined goal.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
    "explanation": "No important non-chain defect is present. All dimensions were handled with excellent safety, reasoning, and family adaptation.",
